<?xml version="1.0"?>
<model>
  <name>cargo_box</name>
  <version>1.0</version>
  <sdf version="1.9">model.sdf</sdf>
  <description>
    The delivery parcel. Created for remediation plan P3.8: PayloadBay.update()
    had been issuing gz set_pose calls against a model name that existed nowhere
    on this machine, so "payload bay kinematically follows the airframe" could
    never have been observed working.

    Deliberately &lt;static&gt;true&lt;/static&gt;: the bay is kinematically
    pose-followed, not physically joined, so it must not fall under gravity
    between pose updates and must not exert reaction forces on the airframe.
  </description>
</model>
